# Copy to .env.local for local development.

# Base URL of the Sampark API this portal calls. Must be a public HTTPS
# origin in any deployed environment — never point this at an internal-only
# hostname the scanner's browser can't reach.
#
# The default below (http://localhost:3001/v1) is only reachable from a
# browser running on the SAME machine as the API. To test from a physical
# phone on the same Wi-Fi/LAN, set this to your computer's LAN IP instead,
# e.g. NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.8:3001/v1, and also add
# that same origin (http://192.168.1.8:3000) to the API's own
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (services/api/.env.example) so the API accepts
# requests from it. Next.js inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables into the
# client bundle at dev-server *start* time — after changing this, restart
# `next dev`/`next build`, a browser refresh alone won't pick it up. See
# docs/LOCAL_DEVELOPMENT.md "Testing on a physical device".
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001/v1
